        "title": "Physical Properties of Minerals",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Each property is a macroscopic expression of crystal structure + bonding\n→ Cleavage follows crystallographic planes (weakest bond directions)\n→ Hardness reflects bond strength and type\n→ Luster reflects interaction of photons with crystal surface/structure\n→ Birefringence reflects optical anisotropy of crystal structure\n```"
    },
