        "section": "mineralogy",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Physical Properties of Minerals",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Scale is ordinal, not interval:\n  The jump from 9 → 10 (corundum → diamond) represents a\n  3–4× jump in absolute hardness (Vickers scale)\n  The jump from 1 → 2 is much smaller"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-PHYSICAL-PROPERTIES.md#009",
