      "text": "KEY DIAGNOSTIC CLEAVAGES:\n  Mica: 1 perfect basal {001} → peels into flat sheets\n  Calcite: 3 perfect {1011} rhombohedral → rhombus fragments\n  Halite: 3 perfect {001} cubic → cubes\n  Pyroxene: 2 at ~90° (square cross-section in thin section)\n  Amphibole: 2 at ~60°/120° (diamond cross-section in thin section)\n  Feldspar: 2 at ~90° but less perfect than pyroxene\n```"
