      },
      "text": "| Fracture type | Appearance | Example |\n|--------------|-----------|---------|\n| Conchoidal | Smooth curved shell-like | Quartz, obsidian, flint |\n| Uneven/irregular | Rough uneven surface | Pyrite, most minerals |\n| Hackly | Jagged, sharp points | Native copper, gold |\n| Splintery | Fibrous splinters | Serpentine, some amphiboles |"
